        "text_6kPLTg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>BeaverCraft is a proud Ukrainian manufacturer of premium wood carving tools. Born out of a necessity to find high-quality, reasonably priced woodcarving tools, BeaverCraft identified a gap in the market where tools lacked a balance of craftsmanship and affordability. This led to the creation of a brand dedicated to producing exceptional products for both amateur and professional woodcarvers.</p>",
